Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.20,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,{\fnSinhala Sangam MN}සැමට සුභ උදෑසනක්. අපි සතිපතා රැස්වීම ආරම්භ කරමු.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:06.00,Dumindu,Dumindu,0,0,0,,{\fnSinhala Sangam MN}ආයුබෝවන්, අද රැස්වීමේ කාර්ය සූචිය බලමු.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:08.00,Dumindu,Dumindu,0,0,0,,{\fnSinhala Sangam MN}මම හොඳින්, ස්තුතියි.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:10.74,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,The quarterly numbers look good,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:13.13,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,but we need to improve the Sinhala\Ntranscription accuracy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:14.21,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,especially for names.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:18.00,Dumindu,Dumindu,0,0,0,,Agreed. I'll review the rules with Zoom &\NTeams <beta> next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:28.00,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,After a long pause: a quote "hello", and a\Ncomma.
